---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How HVAC Boot Camp Works | Online HVAC Training"
  description="See how HVAC Boot Camp works: 27 online modules in Moodle with textbook reading, Ron Walker's videos, and quizzes. Watch a free sample of Ron's teaching."
>
  <div class="standard-page refreshed-how">
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner narrow-hero"><p class="eyebrow">How Boot Camp works</p><h1>Study online. <span>Build understanding step by step.</span></h1><p>Boot Camp is a 27-module course delivered in Moodle. Read the textbook, watch Ron's lessons, and use quizzes to check what you understand as you go.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Explore the course</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/try-boot-camp/">Watch Ron teach</a></div></div></section>

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="today-title"><div class="page-shell">
      <div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow">The paid course today</p><h2 id="today-title">A clear sequence of topics, with work to do in each module.</h2><p>Boot Camp starts at the fundamentals and moves through refrigeration, systems, electricity, heating, and heat pumps. You can study online around your schedule.</p></div>
      <div class="how-steps">
        <article><span>01</span><div><p class="step-label">Enroll</p><h3>Access the course in Moodle</h3><p>Payment is handled at checkout. The course and student login are at hvactraining.academy.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>02</span><div><p class="step-label">Read and watch</p><h3>Work with the textbook and Ron's videos</h3><p>The course uses <em>Residential Construction Academy HVAC, 2nd Edition</em> by Eugene Silberstein, purchased separately, alongside online video instruction.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>03</span><div><p class="step-label">Check your learning</p><h3>Take quizzes as you progress</h3><p>Use the questions to find the topics you need to revisit. Some modules include formulas and conversions that take practice.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>04</span><div><p class="step-label">Apply the foundation</p><h3>Keep learning with supervision</h3><p>Bring your questions and technical vocabulary into conversations with employers and experienced technicians. Practical competence grows in the field.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="page-section soft-section" aria-labelledby="sample-title"><div class="page-shell preview-split">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Hear the instructor</p><h2 id="sample-title">Watch Ron explain a real HVAC concept.</h2><p>His public lesson on the basic refrigeration cycle gives you a feel for his pace and explanations before you enroll.</p><p>It's a sample of Ron's teaching, not a login to the paid course. The 27-module Boot Camp is delivered in Moodle with the textbook, videos, and quizzes described above.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/try-boot-camp/">Watch the free lesson</a></div>
      <div class="comparison-card"><p class="eyebrow">At a glance</p><div><strong>Course</strong><span>27 modules delivered online in Moodle</span></div><div><strong>Learning materials</strong><span>Required textbook purchased separately · Ron's videos · quizzes</span></div><div><strong>Before you enroll</strong><span>Review the curriculum, price, and checkout terms</span></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="fit-title"><div class="page-shell">
      <div class="section-heading center"><p class="eyebrow">Set the right expectation</p><h2 id="fit-title">Online training is one part of becoming a technician.</h2><p>Boot Camp can build an understanding of the systems and language. Employers determine hiring, and safe hands-on work requires training and supervision on real equipment.</p></div>
      <div class="outcome-grid"><article><span>Technical</span><h3>Start with principles</h3><p>Understand heat, refrigerant, airflow, electrical controls, tools, and equipment.</p></article><article><span>Instructor</span><h3>Hear from Ron</h3><p>His video lessons explain the concepts; <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> with a course question.</p></article><article><span>Field</span><h3>Practice with supervision</h3><p>Use what you learned to ask better questions and build real skill alongside experienced people.</p></article></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="page-section final-cta"><div class="page-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Explore before deciding</p><h2>See the topics and the price.</h2><p>Review the 27-module curriculum, the textbook requirement, and the full cost at your own pace.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Course details</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/pricing/">Pricing</a></div></div></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
